    {
      "id": "rh-short-lean",
      "title": "黎曼猜想 Lean 证明的精简重写通过复核",
      "titleId": "rh-short-lean-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "作者 11 月 25 日公布对原来五项 RH／Dirichlet 广义 RH 陈述的精简重写。MIT 次日记录约 7.6 万行的紧凑稿在两台机器上通过沙箱 Comparator，约 30 万行的可读稿在较大机器上也通过。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "滑铁卢大学的独立复核在非沙箱环境中用六种检查器通过紧凑稿。核验对象是同一组陈述的新稿，不是扩大数学结论；Clay 仍列为活动问题。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-26",
      "dateLabel": "11月26日 · 核验进展",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-26",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-26",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "原始来源",
          "url": "https://math.mit.edu/~drew/shortgrh/",
          "icon": false
        },
        {
          "label": "补充说明",
          "url": "https://www.math.uwaterloo.ca/~mrubinst/alpoge_claude_grh/",
          "icon": false
        },
        {
          "label": "补充说明",
          "url": "https://www.claymath.org/millennium/riemann-hypothesis/",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tencent-dfly2",
      "title": "腾讯公开 DFly2 草稿模型权重与训练代码",
      "titleId": "tencent-dfly2-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "发布覆盖 Hy4 Flash、DeepSeek‑V4.1‑Flash 和 GLM‑5.3‑Flash 的草稿权重及报告。在 H20 高并发测试中，DeepSeek 与更强草稿基线的单用户解码速度相当时，CodeSpan64K 和 SWE64K 的总吞吐分别提高 62% 和 81%。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "这些数字是特定长上下文负载的总吞吐，不是单用户加速，也不能外推到消费显卡。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-26",
      "dateLabel": "11月26日 · 公告／发布",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-26",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-26",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "原始来源",
          "url": "https://github.com/Tencent/AngelSpec#latest-news",
          "icon": false
        },
        {
          "label": "补充说明",
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.34776v1",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bambu-s1-scanner",
      "title": "Bambu Lab 发布首款 3D 扫描仪 S1",
      "titleId": "bambu-s1-scanner-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "官方标称最小扫描体积：蓝激光模式 5×5×5 毫米，红外模式 150×150×150 毫米。Bambu Scan 首发面向 Windows。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "最小可扫描物体不等于能还原同尺寸细节；部分编辑工具需连接扫描仪，也不能据此判断整个流程可离线运行。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-26",
      "dateLabel": "11月26日 · 公告／发布",
      "eventDate": "2026-11-26",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-26",
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "原始来源",
          "url": "https://blog.bambulab.com/easy-in-hand-pro-in-every-scan-bambu-lab-introduces-the-s1-3d-scanner/",
          "icon": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llama-cpp110",
      "title": "llama.cpp 1.1.0 扩充模型支持并弃用旧批处理接口",
      "titleId": "llama-cpp110-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "稳定标签加入 Inkling 2 系列、Hy4 Flash 等模型支持，并拆分 DFlash 变体。旧的 llama_batch 仍可用，但已弃用，推荐迁移至 llama_batch_ext。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "使用自定义绑定时先检查 API 兼容性；模型支持不等于每种量化和后端都获得同样的速度。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-26",
